# Unified ignore rules — applies to BOTH checkouts: the local dev tree and the
# VPS deploy tree at /opt/morghdari. Reconciled 2026-10-14. The two sides had
# drifted apart, and the server copy was missing the secret rules entirely —
# a `git add -A` there would have committed .env, .sim.env and the TLS private
# keys. Rule of thumb: anything per-machine or regenerated stays out.

# Pytest full-suite logs (detached local runs)
backend/pytest_full.log
backend/t.log
backend/m410.log
backend/*.log

# Dev-stack runtime scratch (regenerated by scripts/start_dev_stack.sh)
backend/dev-stack-*.pid
backend/celerybeat-schedule.*
*.log

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Django ---
*.sqlite3
backend/staticfiles/
backend/media/  # dev-server upload root (O6 photos; tests use a tempdir)

# --- Env & secrets (NEVER commit — Deployment Guide §3) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.vps.example
.sim.env

# --- Node (the repo ships no Node app; kept for stray local tooling) ---
node_modules/

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig
*.rej

# --- Timestamped backups of config files (local artifacts, not source) ---
# e.g. nginx/nginx.conf.bak-20260917-203605 left on the VPS
*.bak
*.bak-*

# NOTE: backend/openapi.generated.yaml is INTENTIONALLY tracked - it is the
# documented generated mirror, enforced by tests/test_openapi_schema.py.
# Do NOT add it (or *.generated.yaml) to this file.

# --- Freebuff agent workspace (local tooling only) ---
.freebuff/

# --- Agent workspaces (local tooling only, never committed) ---
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
.workbuddy-ai/

# --- Knowledge-graph build output (regenerable via graphify; the shared
# --- graph lives in backend_docs - never commit the local build tree) ---
graphify-out/

# --- Test / coverage artifacts ---
.coverage
.coverage.*
.hypothesis/
coverage.json
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.zcode/
.opencode/

# --- v0.7 rehearsal runtime (never committed) ---
/certs/
/backups/
/certbot-www/
/monitoring/prometheus.runtime.yml
/.deploy_tag

# --- Local MCP + sandbox scaffolds (never committed) ---
.mcp.json
.sim-scaffold3/
.sim-scaffold*/

# --- Agent scratch ---
# NOTE (2026-10-14): findings.md, task_plan.md and HANDOFF.md sit at the repo
# root and ARE tracked on purpose. They are this project's decision record —
# what each milestone discovered, why it was cut that way, and where it goes
# next. They were once listed here as "never committed" scratch; that was wrong
# (and a silent no-op, since ignore rules never apply to already-tracked files).
# The three rules were removed so this file stops contradicting reality.
# baseline-recovery.patch is likewise tracked on purpose; the *.patch rule below
# still guards against stray patch dumps from local tooling, with an explicit
# negation for the one patch this repo ships.
*.patch
!/baseline-recovery.patch

# --- QA scratch (server-side harness, never committed) ---
.tmp-qa/
ops/qa-harness/test_unit_password.txt
